  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"font-family: dotum; line-height: 18px;\">안녕하세요.. ^^</span></p><div style=\"font-family: dotum; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;\">의정부에 있는 경기도과학교육원 북부기초과학교육관에서 올해 매달 1회씩 선생님들께 도움이 되실 수 있는 주제로</div><div style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;\">교사 세미나를 시행하고 있습니다. (연수는 아닙니다.)</div></div><div style=\"font-family: dotum; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: dotum; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">북부기초과학교육관 교사연수신청 페이지( <a href=\"http://ujb.gise.kr/train/check.asp\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">http://ujb.gise.kr/train/check.asp</a> )에서 신청가능하시고요,&nbsp;</div><div style=\"font-family: dotum; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">혹시 관심있는 주제가 있으시면 신청하시길 바랍니다. ^^</div><div style=\"font-family: dotum; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">참가 신청은 매달 말부터 그 다음달 세미나 시작일까지 받습니다. (현재 5월 주제에 대한 신청을 받고 있습니다.)</div><div style=\"font-family: dotum; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: dotum; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&lt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 10pt;\">전문적학습공동체 활성화를 위한 교사 세미나 실시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 23.8pt; word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">가</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">일정</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">해당일</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;18:30 ~ 20:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 23.8pt; word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">나</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">장소</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">북부기초과학교육관</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">의정부 녹양동</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 23.8pt; word-wrap: norm